OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says unified Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' as he meets
OL,5,AIrish prime minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has been
OL,8,Fspeaking to Taoiseach (Irish Prime
OL,9,FMinister) Micheal Martin and other
OL,10,Fleaders on a two-day visit to the
OL,11,FRepublic of Ireland
OL,13,FAsked by reporters earlier about the
OL,14,Fprospect of a unified Ireland, Trump
OL,15,Fsays he doesn't want to "cause any
OL,16,Fproblems" but he thinks it would be a
OL,17,F"great thing", adding "I'd love to see
OL,18,Fit unified"
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
