OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says unified Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' as he meets
OL,5,AIrish prime minister
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's one of those questions where no
OL,8,Fmatter what you say, there's no good
OL,9,Fanswer", the president says, adding
OL,10,Fthat "it would be a cool thing"
OL,12,FNo 10 has responded to Trump's
OL,13,Fcomments, while the Democratic Unionist
OL,14,FParty says Northern Ireland's
OL,15,Fconstitutional future "won't be decided
OL,16,Fby commentary in London, Dublin or
OL,17,FWashington"
OL,19,FTrump will now travel to his golf
OL,20,Fresort in Doonbeg, County Clare, where
OL,21,Fthe Irish Open golf tournament is being
OL,22,Fheld - here's a look at his schedule
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
